
# InsightFlowAI

InsightFlowAI is a data analytics project focused on SQL analytics using Python and SQLite.

## Technologies Used
- Python
- SQL
- SQLite
- Pandas
- Google Colab

## Project Notebook
The main analysis notebook is `InsightFlowAI.ipynb`.

## Execution
Open the notebook in Google Colab and run the cells in sequence. Configure the required Google Drive paths and data files before running.
